::RULE{S0_INTAKE=>obtain seed, market, language, business model, site if any, desired output size and authorized spend cap; no permission inferred from this document; a configuration example such as USD 5 is not approval to spend}
::RULE{S1_ACCESS=>inspect available Google Ads or Planner export, Trends API or user CSV, GSC OAuth and authorized DataForSEO access; ask only for missing access relevant to the run; secrets stay out of chat; missing source stays missing; never synthesize observations}
::RULE{S2_BUDGET=>read current provider prices; estimate calls, retries and cost; obtain run-specific authorization before paid requests; log actual cost; stop before exceeding cap; never recharge automatically}
::RULE{S3_CONFIG=>record country, language, location, device, search type, collection dates and windows; distinguish data-derived values from chosen parameters; suggested starting configuration is 200 candidates, top10 organic results, RRF c=60, BM25 k1=1.2 b=0.75; all are configurable, not universal constants}
::RULE{S4_DISCOVER=>collect related queries and topics through permitted Trends access and suggestions or PAA through authorized SERP provider; preserve source and date; tag brand, navigational, news, sports and transactional intent; exclude only when outside the owner's declared scope; deduplicate exact variants without merging different intents}
::RULE{S5_TREND=>use comparable series from the same scaling context; report recent versus baseline medians, slope and persistence with explicit windows; zero or tiny baseline gives undefined or unstable relative growth, not infinite opportunity; compare seasonally aligned periods when available; do not force a cycle from an insignificant autocorrelation peak}
::RULE{S6_BURST=>run Kleinberg's binomial batch model only with real counts r_t and total counts d_t with 0<=r_t<=d_t; p0=sum(r_t)/sum(d_t), p_i=p0*s^i with valid p_i<=1; emission cost=-log[binomial(d_t,r_t)*p_i^r_t*(1-p_i)^(d_t-r_t)]; upward cost=max(0,j-i)*gamma*log(n); s and gamma require declared choices; Trends indices alone=>skip binomial model and label trend evidence pending validation}
::RULE{S7_VOLUME=>request historical metrics with consistent market, period and network; preserve average and monthly searches, ranges, bids, close variants and missingness; do not add duplicate close-variant groups; advertiser competition is a separate field; growth and trend evidence remain distinct and correlated inputs are flagged}
